            "Requirement already satisfied: regex in /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages (from tiktoken) (2025.11.3)\n",
            "Requirement already satisfied: requests in /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages (from tiktoken) (2.32.4)\n",
            "Requirement already satisfied: charset_normalizer<4,>=2 in /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages (from requests->tiktoken) (3.4.7)\n",
            "Requirement already satisfied: idna<4,>=2.5 in /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages (from requests->tiktoken) (3.15)\n",
